      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:971b17ba99c35e5b5037b3c3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "是Live！诶嘿嘿，要开始享受了～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "8ad7b41eed4a8cdf7a66489450e58eae8ecf212121ffb165da4e601ac69cc21a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "60000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f7d774a9e809a0e92da67673",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "绝～对不要看漏了哟！",
      "source_fingerprint": "378026098a7b90bb29b764d0e825a92ee60bffaf962cd2fc31b255a4f2a72c53",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "60001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a2cfb3a68238b809c6477613",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要以“帝王”为目标，加油了哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "855c065061b37aa5409ca9b49f2bed223d03903a92cf00f3ec4efa17457f9220",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "70000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9457b495ce825e031d929ab3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "从今以后也多多指教了，训练员！\r\n毕竟要实现无敌的帝王传说的话，\r\n可不能没有你啊！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1956704cc257d217e34ffb3dec9b16701a49241948fa3c3ba661cd91ecff851a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "70001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b2da6be56f14de95dbd75e77",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嗯～哼，看上去就像是优等生吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "1dd7025f68f6cfeb4e1c191edb61d419738d0e23a0d516262daebdc0bcf579da",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "70004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ff728a37e7a49933db9afea5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "锵！又帅又可爱对吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5b3a4dd83407cbb2e9b24f056a89d84e41127c5d891f7dbe35f376546d431997",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "70008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:22e95128b50d57543bcd27dd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "无敌的帝王大人，参上！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c77f70c9b2b5e36e2e73365f67e4956da806fe8de09d1ce1b85700c960c1f13b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "70009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:12c51f97ae8d02b9fa5e6992",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "和会长同款的衣服！虽然肯定是一样的就是了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b0536a7443ca82535263d2c95a9137d3f0ab9b388ae1c81672c822efabf3aa0e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "70010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:69e02f47c13bf9042800c87c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "因为我肯定会站在C位，所以就好好期待吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5df7d500476a138d27b44139f8c71f93670bf42ac7b6e2ec170517f81f899383",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "70014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4eeed61128a45c9c7e922284",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我会穿着这件决胜服，赢下比赛给你看的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "24194de1ab959555b891e3a34283369ba17a169c591eb854d4f03e397435e951",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "70015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:75f2efea9137ed9283888e3a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "快看快～看！是件与最强的我\r\n十分相称的决胜服对吧～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "20fd35e1faf5c8ef25a5e396c6b94baba67dd2d60d8781b794f2710fde10f626",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "70016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0b5867a2b804dce89b5ff6bc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "诶哟、小心点哦。\r\n要是碰到的话会被烫伤也说不定哦～？",
      "source_fingerprint": "f7aea033b8f74161f408e57d410574972a94d4e56bcd394b2e6c44afb5195827",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "70017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8e44c1f56730c214205ee3e8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "真帅气啊～……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "94482b9b921bdbc6b57a3ce486bbf333fff987de4c6c4261760a19a5ae77ad5d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "70018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ef6ac362c74dd18e1175eadf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我正是无敌的帝王！",
      "source_fingerprint": "75d32d2961298e018f06060ef43f0fe12d2d5d158bd0850028004859b67cacfc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "70019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:04b6f4a100c5f65ab564979e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哼哼～?\r\n这可是帝王大人的私人生活照喔。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1199cbad9496a6718125dd033c3ef5f6788cb9c599c5fa013ee35e9482b7cc1f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "70020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a060724f280d31d3acbc1751",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "欸～我说啊～快点出去走走嘛～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e6080161f21d4fc033ffaa50da66decce53df80e211d1586495bfe02e12cd365",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "70021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5654bfeb2c11272d643ad0a9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "とっておきの舞い、\r\n見せちゃうからね！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e6d487d8b391c2ba9bbc7d44d477b467fec06d380888e2eab9da0b0bfdc315f3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "70216"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c6b975adb116e8215c9b219d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "この袖、触ってみる？\r\nすべすべして気持ちいいんだ～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "c3551dc881f8c086c680eb4f739efc718f6795666b4639d5ff47f9229ef53f98",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
