      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fbfda4190e3dc75ecb39d2d0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "辛苦了",
      "source_fingerprint": "bd96bf364b8b21a3bb94efcf4ef82feb1bc34cf02203524e7949dbd19151dd13",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "80000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cf1ec80ee5b1719727a30762",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哼～哼！我帝王大人，\r\n接受你的挑战！",
      "source_fingerprint": "373ce2b520eb0f9d089e9a5fe7f0e9ede3075599c6fd9443f6a478a9fa86516a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "81000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ead2e5f365d699915ed554b6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "对手越强的话我的斗志就越熊熊燃烧～！\r\n虽然赢的人肯定是我就是了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c32a1ced2651a2a5a95775abec37c4a0f19ca38589e20aa86dc343ee06297505",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "81001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3ea59edd7fb93ebe9ad85528",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "早上好——！\r\n向着无敌的三冠赛马娘的目标，\r\n今天也要加油咯ー！",
      "source_fingerprint": "63d4763b4e74f79ddf1aa10dd4e1f0ecaea345d57e33649285963b4bf67b88b6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "90000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1fcb4a712b38f89fa3008583",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "咳咳，在场的各位！\r\n帝王大人要进校了，\r\n快快把路让～开！……开玩笑♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "b1afb9b592eeb2a70531104eea2dea2d55f2c8e76cd562df6b09ebbdb9d8cb06",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "90001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:172426f64a4775b9b0e806cf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "刚才呢，来了次突击测试……\r\n但班上只有我是满分！\r\n不愧是我！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0501879566b7167938bdbf6039744bd0fec5518d3ae06a2f611e2560eb737d34",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "90002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1fa0c9135f9930bbaa6d91f2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呐——，见到会长了没？哎～，\r\n我还以为今天一定能在一起吃午饭呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8fa71db6d9a41676b1847a78ecfdad9cd6bc98ae114bb79679b0eeba47773282",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "90003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d4ae15e24ff6e7a8b0d28dda",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练员，辛苦了。\r\n嗯嗯，今天你也为了我辛苦付出了呢♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "05d85d046b5a2d50d05203bd877a0ceb212a369a020f563cb04b22169a24ffce",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "90004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:20761a1ae99d75aa29a58f8f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练员这个时间点也要外出？\r\n我呢，身体运动还不够，\r\n所以一直在闲逛呢～",
      "source_fingerprint": "46995f12035833bd8f7fddc2dd4d2116f3a00c74df9b43da950fe80bb779fd91",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "90005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bc154984a8a1182733073437",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "噗噗——\r\n只有会长当新生的对手真无聊！\r\n明明让我来也没关系的～",
      "source_fingerprint": "f922982df4c0857b9d4250dac6233cf4fb140c7205178dffac3619c90cefed69",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "90006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:724531d69c145a1cbfd41971",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呐～！超强的独角仙，\r\n一起出发去抓吧！\r\n黄金船也有着呢～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "256e731acb4b361dd6e7fce60c109b4b6a4e1c469dfd0deacfcb32591f63e03e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "90007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9af4f0271f8ea6dba7aca102",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练员也来试试走在落叶上吧？\r\n听着沙沙的声音轻响，\r\n心情很棒吧～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "399b8ae09c977b89c180deb0fa1054d52103e41e2426eb16a3f4b7dfe16ac83d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "90008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7831233fee7e9adfc9f00200",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "最近可真冷啊。\r\n啊——啊，都这样了，\r\n等雪积起来就可以尽情玩耍了～",
      "source_fingerprint": "4c2e94296b0486c5fc83390d5530adc0b649eb94e9a50230ec57c98f19d94b97",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "90009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0007d244f9f5f4a14604c0e3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呼～……\r\n开玩笑要和麦昆一起……\r\n不过从早上开始就要认真了哟。",
      "source_fingerprint": "49d3955cff07f8ad4b5e07ad7693dd26fa82b46bc428a71faea0696db56d6ef9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "90010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:979a3358f71448afa8696706",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "蜂蜜～蜂蜜～蜂蜜～♪\r\n果然早上的话，\r\n就是要蜂蜜特饮呢～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "bb5d666c94953006bc94228b8d9f1482e7401ae691ac0b35fe1ee658d7ade8b2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "90011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b6e890eb5ca30c239b4969df",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呐呐，听我说哦！我中午\r\n去后辈们的教室露了一下脸\r\n结果被要签名了呢～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "b82790aa22560e278f594b3d24b39dc78118504e4a744853bb612d6d655a1605",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "90012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:85be3fb5a87776dda9ab1c30",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哈～啊……吃完午饭之后真的\r\n会觉得很困啊～……要不去\r\n学生会办公室稍微睡会好了……",
      "source_fingerprint": "d0898f74f6106145fec1c87fbe82ea445ffc80ef3398c5cad6aee04a8875a3c0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "90013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:06295ce745d046311dac96f8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "为了我忙到这么晚真是辛苦了！\r\n我会好好回应这份感情的，\r\n你就尽请期待吧♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "2905e3d043f066de4387e5373cc0a174183612ae63aa4b8aa6f5a224373c5477",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "90014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0ef7ba00e43ca4824238deb7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "后辈们都好好地回来了吗——\r\n哼哼♪像这样子关心她们也是\r\n前辈的工作♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "e4ff1051ceeadce3976ffe287f84124335ff5ac783febaad049584973897fd89",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "90015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4a5e84ee0d489685747ee3c7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "皋月赏之后就是德比……春季的比赛\r\n真是一个接着一个！嘛，不管哪场比赛\r\n赢的人都会是我就是了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d412516941bbab68bd1dcab885eb1c1af898531452585caa889d276ce73ee05f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "90016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fa3f2e055c9aeac6bd9cd930",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "感觉和大家还有一段距离……\r\n是因为衣服太热了吗？\r\n嘻嘻！追上来喽！",
      "source_fingerprint": "54daa7f9768a5b45bc48d4434c7be0d82600240914a9016a87286ab91f8410ac",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "90017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cb3216a4a9cebb0e1918ca45",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "穿着这身衣服隐藏在落叶中，\r\n谁都不会发觉吧！\r\n好了，下一次去吓吓谁呢——……",
      "source_fingerprint": "2993e315a632136575e12486bdb3da750a97ad0d2cfd97d22ee97d502d00021e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "90018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3e941f3841479bbb4e87b8ef",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "说到冬天就是圣诞节！\r\n说到圣诞节就是红与绿！？\r\n这不就是我和会长衣服的颜色嘛！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e0c91d98ad15ddcd14f968fd34099ce2b8c5a892ec76c951ba8282b23a8bd24e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "90019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6123f58876da0e597a5cbbb3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "情人节快乐～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "89c30a839f4b3a04cb69b06733e358064fb84cd7e12982a53b1f6375b733a7d5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "90020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ef189a1064a8b6c3305659d8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "情人节快乐～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "89c30a839f4b3a04cb69b06733e358064fb84cd7e12982a53b1f6375b733a7d5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "90021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bc076bae4d022d6cd80ac7cd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "早起きは三文の徳！トレーナーも\r\nそう思うでしょ？朝イチで\r\nテイオー様に会えたわけだし♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "ff9401721b4f318baf2568837117ffcc348fab8eb7f5263735b2de00fed80af3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "90210"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:437113cdd2bf4316dbdfd21b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "うとうとしてるなら…\r\nおはようの舞い～！どう？\r\n動くと頭もすっきりするでしょ♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "5d4f00dae2a74ac7e94dfaaa79d31c1210a0f4dbbc3fe455372347ecdba0a626",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "90211"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4f0982549386f439314841d3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ねっ、食後の運動に蹴鞠しない？\r\nテイオー様の名にかけて、\r\n新記録目指しちゃうよ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2ef61303049318fd42188d1f497c1b866868fd66a8d4a05e3c2acabc82326348",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "90212"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6bbc95cd5385a99d22c5454a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "聞いて聞いて～！カイチョーがね\r\n『箸使いが上手いな』…だって！\r\nえへへ、毎食和食にしよっかな～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "adc257d96d6af6e9d0510a18f1ae24fde16ae5ebeea1f0118a91fd3588657301",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "90213"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4642f5c8093befb74149f147",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ていお～ていお～ていていお～。\r\n…にししっ、魔除けのおまじない！\r\nこれで夜道も怖くないでしょ？",
      "source_fingerprint": "eb1592ceb28c140af71468d88375c95a8839f7991d01a167f553598361b7b6a4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "90214"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bb23c5afb7fa55fbaa6779d1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "この時間、幽霊が出るらしいよ…？\r\nボクは平気だけど～、一緒に帰って\r\nあげよっか？…ボクは平気だけど！",
      "source_fingerprint": "654818b26b95c8875810e529383546da5b4349bee83b14b0d97f17eb259ee42f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "90215"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:27ebcd176a45266914dbf8d7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "この前飲んだ『桜抹茶はちみー』\r\nほろ苦さと濃厚な甘さが絶品で…♪\r\n今度、一緒に飲みに行こうよっ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2d67defcb3f4f6e3d929bc2b0d1ddfe9252165cddb01bf87ea92dde70aa01568",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "90216"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:84a2f89f547738d2838ce793",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "最近暑いね～、ぱたぱたって\r\nあおいであげよっか？テイオー様は\r\n扇子の所作もバッチリだもんね♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "12e9f58c92a2934d537054cae72445a170fee5150a147124a6a87787d5ba81f5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "90217"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ded3cccd4d05f2a1f780010e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "『駿大祭』かぁ。古から紡がれた\r\n“想い”…ふふん！ボクたちなら\r\nヨユーで受け継げる！だよねっ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8d85f4e18fb25f1e29d2a87873249d8e44416195aac275630178b58871e183c6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "90218"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2217a247cd87888c9095ac08",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "脚がすーすーするし、雪遊びは\r\n止めとこっかな…ここで一緒に\r\nぬくぬくしようよ、トレーナー！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a8e1ef903075044e567bcad37bb04597557540594ada5caf35f26e0c7e823b16",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "90219"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9a2cbeceb1226f9feb7b321a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ハッピーバレンタイ～ン！",
      "source_fingerprint": "13fb174e5c42d8f0b63609764d837c10d0a379a19c297dd305414fbb66a75dae",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "90221"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ff7bdfaf0451295c34873085",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "在同年级的人当中，我尤其不想\r\n输给麦昆。考试也好竞赛也罢，\r\n我都要赢过她！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b92714f231155caaa3e863c897d3f800277c8916b1b5ba00b8651eac8a633940",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "91000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:24018642ea9616ee8a9e0766",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "下次一起去游戏厅吧！\r\n不管是怎么样的游戏\r\n我都有赢过训练员的自信哦～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "a6fe6abeb50ac5dd38724507b30758a7d14f1c6fafbb7b9173bfa11983083b28",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "91001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:63278cef10e27c0d1d66e6fc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "比赛是很好，但跳舞也很棒呢～！\r\n想让大家觉得我很厉害的话\r\n不管哪个都一样呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b9a032b0754827de026fa819a1e08a4aa685ede0b51547af08abfa24ecd5bd01",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "91002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ef8417cfbed1fdccc3835fa5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "爸爸也好妈妈也好，都经常\r\n打电话过来。根本不用\r\n那么担心的啦～",
      "source_fingerprint": "6854c90486afb00138695f47e184f24a0e0f887e5c923ba27e0e55bde5287607",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "91003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:55eecfc1c563542b2d2ca6b2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呐呐，有什么想知道的事情吗？\r\n哼哼哼……学园里的传言什么的，\r\n我可是稍微有～点了解的哦？",
      "source_fingerprint": "e4b505e895b3cd021a7c14d2e2adcd0c0f824aa023dc09b4e9ea083d1debdeb8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "91004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7698373b1a93f3ef73bb0315",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "怎样怎样？我这身衣服！\r\n很适合我对吧？待会\r\n也去给会长看看～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5d203e79086991f04252d56581854142ef2a467f97be095903303f753d501ff9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "91005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1b0d9a7a8b613140f5ebe6ac",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "即使是舞蹈也很完美哦！\r\n用帝王舞步变得最引人注目，\r\n独占大家的视线～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c351f8848804cb3061ed434a7074323cebf536c8d4bbfebdcf03b0d075a55687",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "91006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fe6b22e3725c0243737d0db8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我的目标是，不会输给任何人的\r\n最强无敌的三冠赛马娘！绝对会\r\n穿着这身决胜服实现给你看的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "bc39a914eb6d79ea1cce0005de44414ddcf989c959ae3bd811cc324a8618bcfa",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "91007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6845dacc2ff2e505c70adb89",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "快看快看，这件红色的披风！\r\n袖子的样式也……诶嘿嘿，我去拜托过\r\n要和会长的是同一款♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "70fb8cfd94061a81880f570fa634f8e4ee4545f9126a6940fa80abfb6a93443d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "91008"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
